// PREPARED ONLY. No actuator links. Install only through a separately authorized
// sole-provider handoff; jdbc.persist already covers everyChange + restore.
// NULL/UNDEF stays unauthorized until the startup owner reconciles persistence.
Switch Shade_Kitchen_RecommendationAutomation "Kitchen automate recommendations" ["Control"]
Switch Shade_LivingRoom_RecommendationAutomation "Living Room automate recommendations" ["Control"]
Switch Shade_Bathroom_RecommendationAutomation "Bathroom automate recommendations" ["Control"]
Switch Shade_Bedroom_RecommendationAutomation "Bedroom automate recommendations" ["Control"]
String Shade_RecommendationAutomationRevision "Shade recommendation policy durable revision" ["Status"]
// Volatile proof of the CURRENT initialized owner; deliberately never restored.
String Shade_RecommendationAutomationSession "Shade recommendation policy current owner session" ["Status"]
